<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>🏡 Chalet Savard — Historique des versions</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#081018;
  --panel:rgba(17,22,29,0.75);
  --border:rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
  --text:#eef5ff;
  --muted:#7f8ea3;
  --blue:#00c8ff;
  --green:#39d98a;
  --purple:#7b61ff;
  --orange:#ff8c42;
}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}
body{
  font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(0,200,255,.12), transparent 25%),
    radial-gradient(circle at bottom right, rgba(123,97,255,.12), transparent 25%),
    linear-gradient(180deg,#071018,#0d141d);
  color:var(--text);
  min-height:100vh;
  padding:24px;
}
.container{max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;}

/* HEADER */
.header{
  display:flex;
  justify-content:space-between;
  align-items:center;
  background:var(--panel);
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:26px;
  backdrop-filter:blur(16px);
  padding:24px 28px;
}
.header h1{font-size:1.6rem;}
.header p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:4px;font-size:.9rem;}
.back-btn{
  display:inline-flex;
  align-items:center;
  gap:8px;
  background:rgba(0,200,255,.08);
  border:1px solid rgba(0,200,255,.15);
  color:var(--blue);
  padding:10px 18px;
  border-radius:999px;
  text-decoration:none;
  font-weight:600;
  font-size:.9rem;
  transition:.2s;
}
.back-btn:hover{background:rgba(0,200,255,.14);transform:translateY(-1px);}

/* TIMELINE */
.timeline{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0;}

.version-card{
  position:relative;
  display:flex;
  gap:24px;
  padding:0 0 32px 0;
}
.version-card:last-child{padding-bottom:0;}

/* ligne verticale */
.version-card::before{
  content:'';
  position:absolute;
  left:19px;
  top:40px;
  bottom:0;
  width:2px;
  background:linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255,255,255,.08), transparent);
}
.version-card:last-child::before{display:none;}

/* point sur la ligne */
.dot-wrap{
  flex-shrink:0;
  width:40px;
  display:flex;
  flex-direction:column;
  align-items:center;
  padding-top:20px;
}
.dot{
  width:14px;
  height:14px;
  border-radius:50%;
  border:2px solid var(--blue);
  background:#081018;
  box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(0,200,255,.4);
  flex-shrink:0;
}
.dot.current{
  background:var(--green);
  border-color:var(--green);
  box-shadow:0 0 14px rgba(57,217,138,.5);
  animation:pulse 2s infinite;
}
@keyframes pulse{0%{transform:scale(1);}50%{transform:scale(1.4);opacity:.6;}100%{transform:scale(1);}}

.card-body{
  flex:1;
  background:var(--panel);
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:20px;
  backdrop-filter:blur(16px);
  padding:20px 24px;
}
.card-body.current-version{
  border-color:rgba(57,217,138,.2);
  box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(57,217,138,.08);
}

.card-top{
  display:flex;
  justify-content:space-between;
  align-items:flex-start;
  margin-bottom:14px;
  gap:12px;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
}
.version-badge{
  font-size:1.1rem;
  font-weight:700;
  color:var(--text);
}
.version-badge span{
  font-size:.75rem;
  font-weight:500;
  color:var(--muted);
  margin-left:8px;
}
.badge-current{
  background:rgba(57,217,138,.1);
  border:1px solid rgba(57,217,138,.2);
  color:var(--green);
  padding:4px 12px;
  border-radius:999px;
  font-size:.75rem;
  font-weight:600;
}
.date{color:var(--muted);font-size:.82rem;}

.changes{
  list-style:none;
  display:flex;
  flex-direction:column;
  gap:7px;
  margin-bottom:16px;
}
.changes li{
  display:flex;
  align-items:flex-start;
  gap:10px;
  font-size:.88rem;
  color:#c8d8e8;
  line-height:1.4;
}
.changes li::before{
  content:'';
  flex-shrink:0;
  width:6px;
  height:6px;
  border-radius:50%;
  background:var(--blue);
  margin-top:6px;
}
.changes li.new::before{background:var(--green);}
.changes li.fix::before{background:var(--orange);}

.card-links{
  display:flex;
  gap:10px;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
}
.link-btn{
  display:inline-flex;
  align-items:center;
  gap:6px;
  padding:7px 14px;
  border-radius:10px;
  font-size:.8rem;
  font-weight:600;
  text-decoration:none;
  transition:.2s;
}
.link-btn:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);}
.link-btn.view{
  background:rgba(0,200,255,.08);
  border:1px solid rgba(0,200,255,.15);
  color:var(--blue);
}
.link-btn.archive{
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
  color:var(--muted);
}
.link-btn.live{
  background:rgba(57,217,138,.08);
  border:1px solid rgba(57,217,138,.15);
  color:var(--green);
}

/* INSTRUCTIONS */
.instructions{
  background:var(--panel);
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:20px;
  backdrop-filter:blur(16px);
  padding:22px 26px;
}
.instructions h2{
  font-size:1rem;
  margin-bottom:14px;
  color:var(--text);
}
.steps{
  list-style:none;
  display:flex;
  flex-direction:column;
  gap:10px;
}
.steps li{
  display:flex;
  align-items:flex-start;
  gap:12px;
  font-size:.86rem;
  color:#c8d8e8;
  line-height:1.5;
}
.step-num{
  flex-shrink:0;
  width:22px;
  height:22px;
  border-radius:50%;
  background:rgba(0,200,255,.12);
  border:1px solid rgba(0,200,255,.2);
  color:var(--blue);
  font-size:.72rem;
  font-weight:700;
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:center;
}
code{
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
  padding:2px 7px;
  border-radius:6px;
  font-size:.82rem;
  color:var(--orange);
  font-family:monospace;
}

.footer{
  text-align:center;
  color:var(--muted);
  font-size:.8rem;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">

  <!-- HEADER -->
  <div class="header">
    <div>
      <h1>🏡 Chalet Savard — Versions</h1>
      <p>Historique complet du Dashboard Météo</p>
    </div>
    <a href="index.html" class="back-btn">← Dashboard actif</a>
  </div>

  <!-- TIMELINE -->
  <div class="timeline">

    <!-- v2 — VERSION ACTIVE -->
    <div class="version-card">
      <div class="dot-wrap">
        <div class="dot current"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="card-body current-version">
        <div class="card-top">
          <div>
            <div class="version-badge">v2.0 <span>Dashboard étendu</span></div>
            <div class="date">Juin 2025</div>
          </div>
          <span class="badge-current">✦ Version active</span>
        </div>
        <ul class="changes">
          <li class="new">Ajout capteur ch3 — Cave (temp. + humidité)</li>
          <li class="new">Ajout capteur ch4 — Chambre des maîtres (temp. + humidité)</li>
          <li class="new">Ajout capteur ch5 — Serre (temp. + humidité)</li>
          <li class="new">Pression barométrique en hPa (relative + absolue)</li>
          <li class="new">Section "Autres pièces" avec graphiques individuels</li>
          <li class="new">Page versions.html + archive v1</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="card-links">
          <a href="index.html" class="link-btn live">▶ Ouvrir le dashboard</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- v1 — ARCHIVÉE -->
    <div class="version-card">
      <div class="dot-wrap">
        <div class="dot"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <div class="card-top">
          <div>
            <div class="version-badge">v1.0 <span>Version initiale</span></div>
            <div class="date">2024</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <ul class="changes">
          <li>Dashboard météo de base — Ecowitt GW3000B</li>
          <li>3 capteurs : Extérieur (ch1), Intérieur, Eau (ch2)</li>
          <li>Graphiques Chart.js avec sélection de plages (1j → 1an)</li>
          <li>Tableau historique des 48 dernières heures</li>
          <li>Alertes gel, chaleur, humidité élevée</li>
          <li>Comparaison Open-Meteo (structure prévue)</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="card-links">
          <a href="versions/v1.html" class="link-btn view">👁 Voir cette version</a>
          <a href="https://github.com/nicholassavard/Dashbord_Meteo_Chalet/blob/main/versions/v1.html" class="link-btn archive" target="_blank">GitHub ↗</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- INSTRUCTIONS -->
  <div class="instructions">
    <h2>📋 Comment archiver une nouvelle version</h2>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li>
        <div class="step-num">1</div>
        <div>Sur GitHub, ouvre <code>index.html</code> → clique <strong>Edit (crayon)</strong></div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <div class="step-num">2</div>
        <div>Sélectionne tout le contenu (<code>Ctrl+A</code>) et copie (<code>Ctrl+C</code>)</div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <div class="step-num">3</div>
        <div>Dans GitHub, crée un nouveau fichier <code>versions/v3.html</code> (ou le prochain numéro) et colle le contenu</div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <div class="step-num">4</div>
        <div>Commit le fichier archive, puis retourne modifier <code>index.html</code> avec ta nouvelle version</div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <div class="step-num">5</div>
        <div>Ouvre <code>versions.html</code> et ajoute une nouvelle entrée dans la timeline avec la date et les changements</div>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">Chalet Savard · Saint-Félicien, Québec · GW3000B Ecowitt</div>

</div>
</body>
</html>
